{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:195da5c178521fb8","name":"Lightwhip","source":{"id":"source:reference-195da5c178521fb8","title":"Lightwhip","revision":18954,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:02:06Z","sha256":"7e7429e80229bca37a509728e326d7d041f1099237722b209dba5c1326282a5f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18954","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Lightwhip&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-195da5c178521fb8","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Lightwhip is similar to a Lightsaber in that it emits a beam of energy from its handgrip. The device differs though, in that the \"blade\" is long and flexible, giving it the properties of a whip. Although a Lightwhip has a greater ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reach"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reach"},", it lacks the power of a more traditional ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Lightwhip has a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reach"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reach"}," of 2 squares. When you hit a target with a Lightwhip, it deals normal damage and you can initiate a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grab","referenceId":"reference:7d935f258918d1a5"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," against the target. A target that is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabbed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabbed"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grappled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grappled"}," can attempt to escape the Lightwhip (requiring a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Acrobatics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acrobatics","referenceId":"reference:0d0b7eee2953750e"}," check). You can use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pin","referenceId":"reference:ff1cee74414621d8"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trip"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trip","referenceId":"reference:bd13d5a0906be48e"}," feats with a Lightwhip, but you cannot use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Crush"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Crush","referenceId":"reference:fd4982bc31020a05"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Throw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Throw","referenceId":"reference:c78054582e89a9a7"}," feats.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Any character that ends its turn in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grab","referenceId":"reference:7d935f258918d1a5"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," from a Lightwhip takes damage equal to the weapon's base damage (you do not add your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," bonus, half your Heroic Level, or any other modifiers to this damage).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Lightwhip requires a special ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"}," to operate (the cost is ten times the price of an ordinary ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"},", but it lasts almost indefinitely).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Medium\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 5,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d4\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 1 Kilogram\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Energy and Slashing\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
